  "正餘弦疊合：$a\\sin x + b\\cos x = \\sqrt{a^2+b^2}\\sin(x+\\phi)$": "Combining sine and cosine: $a\\sin x + b\\cos x = \\sqrt{a^2+b^2}\\sin(x+\\phi)$",
