  "空間外積：$\\vec{u} \\times \\vec{v}$ 同時垂直於 $\\vec{u}$ 與 $\\vec{v}$，其長度等於兩向量所夾平行四邊形面積": "The cross product $\\vec{u} \\times \\vec{v}$ is perpendicular to both vectors; its magnitude is the area of the parallelogram they span",
